              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Holiday Baker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I thought this was pretty good. It kind of had both a sweet and salty taste. I used 3 NY strip steak, because it was all I had. I also just put the green onion directly in the marinade and used a sweet white wine I had. I put the meat on 6 skewers, with a generous 8-9 1\" pieces of meat. They broiled in about 11 minutes, flipping twice.",
